sequenceDiagram
    participant CA as Client app
    participant CK as Client kernel
    participant SK as Server kernel
    participant SA as Server app
    SA->>SK: bind and listen
    CA->>CK: connect
    CK->>SK: SYN
    SK->>CK: SYN and ACK
    CK->>SK: ACK
    SA->>SK: accept
    SK-->>SA: Connected descriptor
    CA->>CK: send bytes
    CK->>SK: Stream bytes
    SA->>SK: recv
    SK-->>SA: Available bytes
